Package: hd-config
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian configuration database
 Keeps the hyprdebian configuration in the JSON object in
 /etc/hyprdebian/config.json. Other hyprdebian packages write their
 settings there under a key of their own.
 .
 hd-config-update adds a key or replaces its value, hd-config-remove removes
 keys. Both are run as root.
